sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Borrower
    participant Client as Next.js Client UI
    participant Server as Next.js Server Action
    participant ML as FastAPI ML Service (SOM)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Prisma)

    Borrower->>Client: Submit Application Data
    Client->>Server: submitLoanApplication(payload)
    Server->>Server: Validate JWT Session & Zod Schema
    Server->>ML: POST /api/v1/predict-risk (Applicant Vector)
    alt ML Service Online
        ML->>ML: Map vector onto SOM Grid & calculate cluster distance
        ML-->>Server: 200 OK { riskGrade: "B", defaultProb: 0.042, interestRate: 0.085 }
    else ML Service Offline / Timeout
        Server->>Server: Execute deterministic credit fallback rules
    end
    Server->>DB: INSERT INTO Loan (status = 'FUNDING', riskGrade, interestRate)
    DB-->>Server: Loan Record Created
    Server-->>Client: Application Approved & Listed